    "title": "CA18707 - RFQ 2026/49 - NMANDD PEACEPLUS Thriving Together - Celebrating Cultures and Diversity - 3.5 Women's Festival",
    "description": "Competent and creative suppliers are invited to tender for the design, development, and delivery of a two-stage Women's Festival. \r\nStage 1 will deliver pre-festival workshops and a cross-border learning visit to build the confidence, skills and independence of women from diverse backgrounds. Activities will focus on practical life skills, wellbeing, leadership and personal development, with opportunities to build networks and learn from inspiring women and community organisations. Stage 2 will culminate in an Inclusive Women's Festival around International Women's Day 2027, celebrating participants' achievements through taster sessions, demonstrations, information stands and talks. The festival will showcase learning outcomes while encouraging attendees to access support, explore new interests and connect with local groups.\r\n\r\n\r\nTo access this competition: \r\n\r\nRegistered:\r\nLogin to https://suppliers.multiquote.com and view the opportunity CA18707.\r\n\r\nNot registered:\r\nVisit https://suppliers.multiquote.com then register and quote CA18707 as the reason for registration. \r\n\r\n Any queries please contact MultiQuote on 020 3920 8054.",
